  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "fieldframe:text",
      "text": "A **Boiler** underneath boils water from the **Orange tank** into steam in the **Green tank**, burning coal from **Purple storage**. A **Steam Turbine** on top turns the steam into RF, and a **Condenser** on the left side returns most of the water to the Orange tank. A **Tank Access Panel** in front lets you pour water in with a bucket, an **Inventory Access Panel** at the back takes coal, and a **Power Terminal** on the right provides RF to whatever touches it."
    },
