    {
      "type": "fieldframe:text",
      "text": "At full speed one Boiler gives 80 RF/t, twice what a Fuel Engine gets from the same coal; the turbine needs about 15 seconds to spin up. The Condenser returns 90% of the water with water against it, half in open air, so place the machine next to a water source and it barely needs topping up."
